	(text "HV power domain (PGND)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 157.48 39.37 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "edf05071-c0ac-565a-925d-3cfd336ea343"))
	(text "LV control domain (GND_ISO)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 45.72 143.51 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "a4659af0-50cf-5b5e-84b9-eeb75049b277"))
	(text "DOMAINS\n  HV power (PGND): input protection, power stage, aux supply + fan, HV side of isolation parts.\n  LV control (GND_ISO): controller, fault logic, LEDs, J4 rack I/O, LV side of isolation parts.\n  Barrier crossings: Si8274 x2, AMC3301 x2 (phase sheets); AMC3330, AT1, AT2, PS1 (isolation sheet).\n\nRAILS\n  VBUS 72 V (64.8-79.2 V) after hot-swap      +24V  24 V / 46 A output\n  +5V_PWR 5.2 V (LM5012): drivers, fan, PS1    +5V_ISO 5 V isolated (PS1): controller, logic\n\nPROTECTION\n  UVLO 62.3 / 60.3 V and OVP 81.9 V (LM5069 + U22); reverse polarity (Q2 + U13); TVS D6; F1 25 A.\n  OCP: 36 A peak cycle-by-cycle per phase (INA301), 28 A/phase average with hiccup (LTC3861).\n  Latched: output OVP 27 V, OTP 80 C. All faults -> RUN_OK. Latches clear on input power cycle.\n\nSHEETS: 2 Input protection | 3 Power stage (4, 5 = Phase 1, Phase 2) | 6 Aux supply + fan |\n        7 Isolation | 8 Controller (9 = Fault logic and rack I/O)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 157.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "8f48d0c3-3ab6-5a44-a64e-bec313734c0f"))
